  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、楽しそうだな\r\n何を読んでるんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008110020,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あ、プロデューサーさん……\r\nこれ……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500811/2015008110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、『好きなもの探し』したコラムが載ってる雑誌か",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008110030,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500811/2015008110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008110031,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……『好きなもの探し』、楽しかったなぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500811/2015008110031"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。新しい甜花の一面に触れられたって\r\nファンにも好評だったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008110040,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "に、にへへ……\r\nプロデューサーさんのおかげ……だね……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500811/2015008110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことないさ\r\n甜花が頑張ったからだよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008110050,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そ、そうかな……\r\nにへへ……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500811/2015008110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008110060,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……ほ、ほんとはね、\r\nもっといっぱい、コラム、書いたんだ……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500811/2015008110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、そうだったのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008110070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……\r\nプロデューサーさんと、探した以外の、ことも……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500811/2015008110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008110080,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花……国語とか、作文とか、苦手で……\r\nなーちゃんに……手伝ってもらってばっか、だったから……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500811/2015008110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008110090,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "いっぱい書いたら……いいの、書けるかなって……\r\n……甜花、頑張った……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500811/2015008110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008110100,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "でも、やっぱり……\r\nプロデューサーさんと見つけた 『好き』が、いいなって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500811/2015008110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか……\r\n……他には、どんなことを書いたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015008110110,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "え？　えっと、えっと……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500811/2015008110110"
  },
  {
